## Status

`CLOSED_EXACT_H02_PREFIX_STRUCTURAL_GAP_LOCALIZATION`

The selected H02 bordered matrix has the exact ordered form

```text
[[A_core, U],
 [W,          0]],
```

with a `24,767`-dimensional invertible core followed by the 34 G3BZ update
